  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to take (measures); to devise; to work out",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to take (measures); to devise (a plan, countermeasure)",
      "explanation": "To work out and put into effect a plan or countermeasure to deal with a problem. A formal verb used mostly with words like {対策|たいさく} or {措置|そち}."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "27841_koujiru_ex1",
      "japanese": "⟦{対策|たいさく}→対策：02511_taisaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{講|こう}じる。",
      "english": "To take countermeasures.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27841_koujiru_ex2",
      "japanese": "⟦{政府|せいふ}→政府：03294_seifu⟧⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧⟦{新|あら}た→新た：01697_arata⟧な⟦{措置|そち}→措置：05519_sochi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{講|こう}じた。",
      "english": "The government took new measures.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "27841_koujiru_ex3",
      "japanese": "⟦{被害|ひがい}→被害：02572_higai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{広|ひろ}がる→広がる：01980_hirogaru⟧⟦{前|まえ}→前：02255_mae⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧、⟦{何|なん}らか→何らか：18430_nanraka⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{講|こう}じる⟦{必要|ひつよう}→必要：00846_hitsuyou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦ある→ある：00006_aru⟧。",
      "english": "We need to take some kind of action before the damage spreads.",
      "sense_numbers": [
