  ],
  "notes": "A formal verb meaning to devise and carry out a plan. Almost always pairs with words for measures or steps. The variant {講|こう}ずる is identical in meaning and slightly more literary.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{対策|たいさく}→対策：02511_taisaku⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{講|こう}じる: to take countermeasures\n- ⟦{措置|そち}→措置：05519_sochi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{講|こう}じる: to take a measure\n- ⟦{手|て}→手：00569_te⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{講|こう}じる: to take a step / do something about it",
